    "VersionText":"* More relialible kill app on OpenGL error\n* made time edit menu rolling from 90s to 600s + infinity\n* Save statistics after each round\n* give extra trigger bomb if availibility already exists and a new bomb is taken\n* Spawn bricks on haunted hall only if there is no player close\n* GTK3 now default on Linux\n* Improved SDL2 errormessage",
